    <briefdescription>
<para>In-process exponential-backoff retry gate. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Executes a callable up to <computeroutput>1 + max_retries</computeroutput> times, sleeping between attempts using a 1×/2×/4× backoff schedule. If <computeroutput>jitter_enabled</computeroutput> is set, a uniform random fraction of <computeroutput>base_delay</computeroutput> is added to each sleep.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>No real I/O; designed for unit-testable in-process use. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
